{"seq":1,"slug":"network-observability","title":"网络可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/observability/network-observability","wordCount":1140,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"网络可观测性\">网络可观测性</h1><p>eBPF 在网络可观测性领域的核心优势是<strong>零侵入的全栈可视化</strong>——无需修改应用代码、无需注入 sidecar 代理，仅凭内核态程序即可捕获每一个 TCP 连接的建立与断开、每一次 DNS 查询的延迟与结果、每一个 HTTP 请求的方法与状态码。这种从 L3 到 L7 的协议感知能力，使得 eBPF 成为 2026 年 Kubernetes 网络可观测性的标准底座。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>网络可观测性的目标是把「谁在和谁通信、发生了什么」还原为结构化事件。eBPF 的做法是在连接生命周期与协议解析两个层面同时切入：连接层通过 kprobe/tracepoint 捕获四元组、状态变迁与重传，协议层通过 tc 与 uprobe 解析 L7 明文。这种「内核态直接观测」避免了 sidecar 的部署与资源开销，但也带来两个必须权衡的约束——加密流量需要 uprobe 协助解密点，以及高频 hook 上的开销必须受控。因此，追踪点选择与聚合策略（在内核态把原始事件压缩为指标）是网络可观测性设计的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连接追踪与流可视化\">连接追踪与流可视化</h2><p>网络可观测性的基础是知道「谁在和谁通信」。eBPF 通过挂载到 TCP 状态机的关键函数，实现完整的连接生命周期追踪。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 追踪 TCP 连接建立&#10;SEC(&quot;kprobe/tcp_v4_connect&quot;)&#10;int trace_connect(struct pt_regs *ctx)&#10;{&#10;    struct sock *sk = (struct sock *)PT_REGS_PARM1(ctx);&#10;    u32 pid = bpf_get_current_pid_tgid() &gt;&gt; 32;&#10;&#10;    struct conn_info info = {};&#10;    info.pid = pid;&#10;    info.ts = bpf_ktime_get_ns();&#10;    bpf_get_current_comm(&amp;info.comm, sizeof(info.comm));&#10;&#10;    // 暂存到 hash map，等 connect 返回后补充目标地址&#10;    bpf_map_update_elem(&amp;sock_map, &amp;sk, &amp;info, BPF_ANY);&#10;    return 0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 追踪 TCP 状态变迁&#10;SEC(&quot;tracepoint/sock/inet_sock_set_state&quot;)&#10;int trace_state(struct trace_event_raw_inet_sock_set_state *ctx)&#10;{&#10;    // 捕获 ESTABLISHED、CLOSE_WAIT、TIME_WAIT 等状态&#10;    if (ctx-&gt;newstate == TCP_ESTABLISHED) {&#10;        // 记录连接建立时间&#10;    }&#10;    if (ctx-&gt;newstate == TCP_CLOSE) {&#10;        // 计算连接持续时间，输出到 ring buffer&#10;    }&#10;    return 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 追踪 TCP 连接建立</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kprobe/tcp_v4_connect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trace_connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pt_regs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PT_REGS_PARM1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u32 pid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bpf_get_current_pid_tgid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn_info info </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    info.pid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pid;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    info.ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bpf_ktime_get_ns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    bpf_get_current_comm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">info.comm, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(info.comm));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 暂存到 hash map，等 connect 返回后补充目标地址</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    bpf_map_update_elem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E