D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TCP_ESTABLISHED) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 记录连接建立时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ctx->newstate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TCP_CLOSE) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 计算连接持续时间，输出到 ring buffer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App as 应用进程&#10;    participant Kernel as Linux 内核&#10;    participant eBPF as eBPF 程序&#10;    participant USpace as 用户态采集器&#10;&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Kernel: connect() 系统调用&#10;    Kernel-&gt;&gt;eBPF: 触发 tcp_v4_connect kprobe&#10;    eBPF-&gt;&gt;eBPF: 记录 PID/时间戳到 map&#10;    Kernel-&gt;&gt;eBPF: inet_sock_set_state (ESTABLISHED)&#10;    eBPF-&gt;&gt;eBPF: 补充四元组信息&#10;    eBPF-&gt;&gt;USpace: Ring Buffer 输出连接事件&#10;    Note over App,Kernel: 数据传输阶段&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Kernel: close() 系统调用&#10;    Kernel-&gt;&gt;eBPF: inet_sock_set_state (CLOSE)&#10;    eBPF-&gt;&gt;USpace: 输出连接关闭 + 持续时间 + 字节数\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as 应用进程\n    participant Kernel as Linux 内核\n    participant eBPF as eBPF 程序\n    participant USpace as 用户态采集器\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;Kernel: connect() 系统调用\n    Kernel-&gt;&gt;eBPF: 触发 tcp_v4_connect kprobe\n    eBPF-&gt;&gt;eBPF: 记录 PID/时间戳到 map\n    Kernel-&gt;&gt;eBPF: inet_sock_set_state (ESTABLISHED)\n    eBPF-&gt;&gt;eBPF: 补充四元组信息\n    eBPF-&gt;&gt;USpace: Ring Buffer 输出连接事件\n    Note over App,Kernel: 数据传输阶段\n    App-&gt;&gt;Kernel: close() 系统调用\n    Kernel-&gt;&gt;eBPF: inet_sock_set_state (CLOSE)\n    eBPF-&gt;&gt;USpace: 输出连接关闭 + 持续时间 + 字节数</pre><p>关键追踪点选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>追踪目标</th>\n<th>推荐挂载点</th>\n<th>获取的信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TCP 连接建立</td>\n<td><code>tcp_v4_connect</code> / <code>tcp_v6_connect</code></td>\n<td>源/目标地址、PID、进程名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCP 状态变迁</td>\n<td><code>tracepoint/sock/inet_sock_set_state</code></td>\n<td>旧/新状态、四元组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCP 重传</td>\n<td><code>tracepoint/tcp/tcp_retransmit_skb</code></td>\n<td>重传次数、序列号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCP RTT</td>\n<td><code>fentry/tcp_rcv_established</code></td>\n<td>srtt_us、mdev_us</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接关闭原因</td>\n<td><code>tcp_done</code></td>\n<td>RST/FIN/超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UDP 发送/接收</td>\n<td><code>udp_sendmsg</code> / <code>udp_recvmsg</code></td>\n<td>负载大小、目标地址</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"dns-监控与异常检测\">DNS 监控与异常检测</h2><p>DNS 是微服务通信的起点——DNS 延迟或解析失败会级联影响整个调用链。eBPF 可以在内核层捕获 DNS 查询与响应，无需修改 resolv.conf 或部署 CoreDNS 插件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 在 UDP 53 端口捕获 DNS 响应&#10;SEC(&quot;tc&quot;)&#10;int parse_dns_response(struct __sk_buff *skb)&#10;{&#10;    void *data = (void *)(long)skb-&gt;data;&#10;    void *data_end = (void *)(long)skb-&gt;data_end;&#10;&#10;    // 解析 Ethernet -&gt; IP -&gt; UDP 头&#10;    struct ethhdr *eth = data;&#10;    if ((void *)(eth + 1) &gt; data_end) return TC_ACT_OK;&#10;&#10;    struct iphdr *ip = (void *)(eth + 1);&#10;    if ((void *)(ip + 1) &gt; data_end) return TC_ACT_OK;&#10;&#10;    if (ip-&gt;protocol != IPPROTO_UDP) return TC_ACT_OK;&#10;&#10;    struct udphdr *udp = (void *)ip + (ip-&gt;ihl &lt;&lt; 2);&#10;    if ((void *)(udp + 1) &gt; data_end) return TC_ACT_OK;&#10;&#10;    // 源端口 53 = DNS 响应&#10;    if (bpf_ntohs(udp-&gt;source) == 53) {&#10;        // 解析 DNS 头：事务ID、响应码、记录数&#10;        struct dns_header *dns = (void *)(udp + 1);&#10;        if ((void *)(dns + 1) &gt; data_end) return TC_ACT_OK;&#10;&#10;        struct dns_event evt = {};&#10;        evt.rcode = dns-&gt;rcode;&#10;        evt.latency_ns = calculate_latency(dns-&gt;id);&#10;        bpf_ringbuf_output(&amp;events, &amp;evt, sizeof(evt), 0);&#10;    }&#10;    return TC_ACT_OK;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 UDP 53 端口捕获 DNS 响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parse_dns_response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> __sk_buff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">skb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">