rk:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'P'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'O'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'S'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'T'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'H'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'T'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'T'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'P'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // HTTP 响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"tls-流量的处理\">TLS 流量的处理</h3><p>加密流量是 eBPF 网络可观测性的主要挑战。主流方案通过 uprobe 挂载到用户态 TLS 库的读写函数，在加密前/解密后截获明文数据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>TLS 库</th>\n<th>uprobe 挂载点</th>\n<th>覆盖场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OpenSSL</td>\n<td><code>SSL_read</code>, <code>SSL_write</code></td>\n<td>大多数 C/C++/Python/Ruby 服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BoringSSL</td>\n<td><code>SSL_read</code>, <code>SSL_write</code></td>\n<td>Go 1.17 之前、Chrome</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go crypto/tls</td>\n<td><code>crypto/tls.(*Conn).Read/Write</code></td>\n<td>Go 服务（需 DWARF 信息）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GnuTLS</td>\n<td><code>gnutls_record_recv/send</code></td>\n<td>部分 Linux 工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[加密数据包到达] --&gt; B{内核层 tc/XDP}&#10;    B --&gt; C[四元组提取/流量统计]&#10;    C --&gt; D{需要 L7 解析?}&#10;    D --&gt;|明文| E[内核态直接解析]&#10;    D --&gt;|TLS| F[uprobe 挂载 SSL_read/write]&#10;    F --&gt; G[在加密前/解密后获取明文]&#10;    G --&gt; H[协议解析: HTTP/gRPC/MySQL]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[结构化事件输出到 Ring Buffer]\">flowchart TD\n    A[加密数据包到达] --&gt; B{内核层 tc/XDP}\n    B --&gt; C[四元组提取/流量统计]\n    C --&gt; D{需要 L7 解析?}\n    D --&gt;|明文| E[内核态直接解析]\n    D --&gt;|TLS| F[uprobe 挂载 SSL_read/write]\n    F --&gt; G[在加密前/解密后获取明文]\n    G --&gt; H[协议解析: HTTP/gRPC/MySQL]\n    E --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[结构化事件输出到 Ring Buffer]</pre><h2 id=\"流量统计与-golden-signals\">流量统计与 Golden Signals</h2><p>将 eBPF 采集的原始连接数据聚合为 Golden Signals（延迟、流量、错误率、饱和度），是网络可观测性的最终交付物。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 每服务粒度的 RED 指标聚合&#10;struct service_key {&#10;    u32 src_ip;&#10;    u32 dst_ip;&#10;    u16 dst_port;&#10;    u8  protocol;  // HTTP, gRPC, MySQL...&#10;};&#10;&#10;struct service_metrics {&#10;    u64 request_count;&#10;    u64 error_count;       // 5xx 或协议错误&#10;    u64 latency_sum_ns;    // 用于计算平均延迟&#10;    u64 latency_hist[16];  // log2 直方图&#10;    u64 bytes_sent;&#10;    u64 bytes_recv;&#10;};&#10;&#10;struct {&#10;    __uint(type, BPF_MAP_TYPE_PERCPU_HASH);&#10;    __uint(max_entries, 65536);&#10;    __type(key, struct service_key);&#10;    __type(value, struct service_metrics);&#10;} service_stats SEC(&quot;.maps&quot;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每服务粒度的 RED 指标聚合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> service_key {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u32 src_ip;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u32 dst_ip;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u16 dst_port;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u8  protocol;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // HTTP, gRPC, MySQL...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> service_metrics {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u64 request_count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u64 error_count;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 5xx 或协议错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u64 latency_sum_ns;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 用于计算平均延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u64 </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">latency_hist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // log2 直方图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u64 bytes_sent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u64 bytes_recv;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    __uint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(type, BPF_MAP_TYPE_PERCPU_HASH);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    __uint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(max_entries, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">65536</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    __type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> service_key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    __type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> service_metrics);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} service_stats </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".maps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用户态采集器每 15-30 秒读取一次 map 数据，聚合所有 CPU 的计数器后输出为 Prometheus 格式的指标或 OpenTelemetry span。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产部署架构\">生产部署架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Node[&quot;Kubernetes 节点&quot;]&#10;        A[Pod A] &amp; B[Pod B] &amp; C[Pod C]&#10;        D[eBPF Agent DaemonSet]&#10;        D --&gt;|XDP/tc| E[网卡]&#10;        D --&gt;|uprobe| A&#10;        D --&gt;|uprobe| B&#10;        D --&gt;|uprobe| C&#10;    end&#10;    D --&gt; F[Ring Buffer]&#10;    F --&gt; G[用户态处理]&#10;    G --&gt; H[OpenTelemetry Collector]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Prometheus / Grafana]&#10;    H --&gt; J[Jaeger / Tempo]\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Node[\"Kubernetes 节点\"]\n        A[Pod A] &amp; B[Pod B] &amp; C[Pod C]\n        D[eBPF Agent DaemonSet]\n        D --&gt;|XDP/tc| E[网卡]\n        D --&gt;|uprobe| A\n        D --&gt;|uprobe| B\n        D --&gt;|uprobe| C\n    end\n    D --&gt; F[Ring Buffer]\n    F --&gt; G[用户态处理]\n    G --&gt; H[OpenTelemetry Collector]\n    H --&gt; I[Prometheus / Grafana]\n    H --&gt; J[Jaeger / Tempo]</pre><p><strong>DaemonSet 模型的优势</strong>：每节点一个 agent（而非每 Pod 一个 sidecar），资源消耗与 Pod 数量解耦。在 500 Pod 的节点上，一个 eBPF agent 消耗约 200-400MB 内存和 1-2% CPU，而等价的 sidecar 方案需要 75GB+ 内存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>连接层观测</strong>：以 <code>tcp_v4_connect</code> 与 <code>inet_sock_set_state</code> 捕获四元组、状态变迁、重传与 RTT，构建完整的流生命周期</li>\n<li><strong>L7 解析</strong>：明文协议在内核态 tc 直接解析；TLS 流量需通过 uprobe 挂载 SSL_read/SSL_write，在加解密前后取明文</li>\n<li><strong>DNS 是级联故障起点</strong>：延迟、NXDOMAIN/SERVFAIL 率与外部 DNS 逃逸是网络可观测性的首要指标</li>\n<li><strong>交付物是 Golden Signals</strong>：把原始连接数据聚合为每服务的 RED 指标，通过 Ring Buffer 输出到 OpenTelemetry Collector</li>\n<li><strong>DaemonSet 优于 sidecar</strong>：每节点一个 agent 让资源消耗与 Pod 数量解耦，500 Pod 节点上内存差可达两个数量级</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"system-tracing-profiling\">系统追踪与性能分析</a> 从系统调用和 CPU 层面补充可观测性维度；<a href=\"security-monitoring\">安全监控</a> 将网络事件与安全策略结合实现威胁检测。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网络可观测性","id":"网络可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"连接追踪与流可视化","id":"连接追踪与流可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"DNS 监控与异常检测","id":"dns-监控与异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"L7 协议解析","id":"l7-协议解析"},{"level":3,"text":"HTTP 解析策略","id":"http-解析策略"},{"level":3,"text":"TLS 流量的处理","id":"tls-流量的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"流量统计与 Golden Signals","id":"流量统计与-golden-signals"},{"level":2,"text":"生产部署架构","id":"生产部署架构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"eBPF Map 与 Helper 函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/foundations/ebpf-maps-helpers"},"next":{"title":"系统追踪与性能分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/observability/system-tracing-profiling"}}